{"1944880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Drop Command", "steam_appid": 1944880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/d4f988a7d0d2c2f8bacfe1e9b2a395ba.poster.avif?t=1786121702\" width=780 height=86 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/d4f988a7d0d2c2f8bacfe1e9b2a395ba.webm?t=1786121702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/d4f988a7d0d2c2f8bacfe1e9b2a395ba.mp4?t=1786121702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mech combat at a grand scale</strong>: Engage in <strong>combined arms combat</strong> where you pilot any unit under your command. From small skirmishes to epic battles, conquer rivals as you build a stellar empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/da86163ad2b5e3cd98c888a92f6fa740.poster.avif?t=1786121702\" width=780 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/da86163ad2b5e3cd98c888a92f6fa740.webm?t=1786121702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/da86163ad2b5e3cd98c888a92f6fa740.mp4?t=1786121702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drop into combat</strong>. Either alone, leading your squad, or commanding an army. Take part in the evolving battlefield, with <strong>fully destructible debris</strong> and unit wreckage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/00d6036f86e9ccac026168849e76da50.poster.avif?t=1786121702\" width=780 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/00d6036f86e9ccac026168849e76da50.webm?t=1786121702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/00d6036f86e9ccac026168849e76da50.mp4?t=1786121702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize and level up your pilots</strong> as they gain experience. Build elite squads of battle hardened soldiers, or rush your opponent with disposable rookies. <strong>Personalize your empire</strong> and <strong>modify  your Mech</strong>, Tank, VTOL, or Battle Armour to suit the mission at hand.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/ec2ad9a6ff7bdaaa800f0f22195d8e42.poster.avif?t=1786121702\" width=780 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/ec2ad9a6ff7bdaaa800f0f22195d8e42.webm?t=1786121702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/ec2ad9a6ff7bdaaa800f0f22195d8e42.mp4?t=1786121702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wage war</strong> across the star cluster in a procedural campaign. <strong>Face logistic and tactical decisions</strong> as you vie for control of strategic resources, pivotal systems, manufacturing hubs, and political objectives. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/64cdd2f0cb14d320f901ae2461107764.poster.avif?t=1786121702\" width=780 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/64cdd2f0cb14d320f901ae2461107764.webm?t=1786121702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/64cdd2f0cb14d320f901ae2461107764.mp4?t=1786121702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completed or failed mission objectives will have <strong>serious consequences</strong> as they impact future campaign operations. <strong>Champions will rise</strong> across the cluster, and establish pirate factions, mercenary companies, or even rival empires!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/8c6f85ff72ab73ec39cae74ddb4d30e9.poster.avif?t=1786121702\" width=780 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/8c6f85ff72ab73ec39cae74ddb4d30e9.webm?t=1786121702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/8c6f85ff72ab73ec39cae74ddb4d30e9.mp4?t=1786121702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conduct diplomacy</strong> with planetary governments and rivals. Strike a balance between empire growth and peaceful coexistence, or wage war without regard to the consequences...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/3fdfb2352e3a3baaae61c6d124630e75.poster.avif?t=1786121702\" width=780 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/3fdfb2352e3a3baaae61c6d124630e75.webm?t=1786121702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/3fdfb2352e3a3baaae61c6d124630e75.mp4?t=1786121702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/d4f988a7d0d2c2f8bacfe1e9b2a395ba.poster.avif?t=1786121702\" width=780 height=86 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/d4f988a7d0d2c2f8bacfe1e9b2a395ba.webm?t=1786121702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/d4f988a7d0d2c2f8bacfe1e9b2a395ba.mp4?t=1786121702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mech combat at a grand scale</strong>: Engage in <strong>combined arms combat</strong> where you pilot any unit under your command. From small skirmishes to epic battles, conquer rivals as you build a stellar empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1944880/extras/da86163ad2b5e3cd98c888a92f6fa740.poster.avif?t=1786121702\" width=780 height=156 ><s